_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 100
---
order: 100
---
short_label: X.100
---
statement: The square on a minor straight line applied to a rational straight line produces as breadth a fourth apotome.
---
proof:

Let *AB* be a minor and *CD* a rational straight line, and to the rational straight line *CD* let *CE* be applied equal to the square on *AB* and producing *CF* as breadth.

I say that *CF* is a fourth apotome.

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="370" height="180" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="X.100 diagram" src="propX100.gif"/></noscript>
